  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3207.10 Use of Allowances by Utilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3207.10 Use of Allowances by Utilities. Pursuant to RSA 125-J:5, XIII, the use of allowances by a utility as defined in RSA 362:2 shall be subject to such additional conditions as ordered pursuant to applicable law by the New Hampshire public utilities commission (PUC).\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
